                {
                  "id": "ca7aad3e74178dda6ff93cadd962594ae0a2c174",
                  "shortId": "ca7aad3",
                  "author": {
                    "name": "Max Schillinger",
                    "email": "redacted@example.invalid",
                    "time": "2023-10-30T17:44:52+01:00"
                  },
                  "committer": {
                    "name": "Drew DeVault",
                    "email": "redacted@example.invalid",
                    "time": "2023-10-31T08:12:15+01:00"
                  },
                  "message": "fix formatting of escaped backticks\n\nCurrently, an escaped backtick (\\`) is translated to \\\\` which gets\nrendered as \"Left Single Quotation Mark\" (‘) (for a UTF-8 locale).\n\nThis commit translates \\` to \\` which results in an actual backtick in\nthe rendered man page.\n",
                  "parents": [
                    {
                      "id": "0b4a102bcf5408896c237a2c35ca7663f8d84ff2"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "0b4a102bcf5408896c237a2c35ca7663f8d84ff2",
