                  "committer": {
                    "name": "Drew DeVault",
                    "email": "redacted@example.invalid",
                    "time": "2023-10-30T09:31:37+01:00"
                  },
                  "message": "Emit '\\e' instead of '\\\\'\n\nI noticed that the rc shell's docs are messed up when using\nman-db, but fine with mandoc. '\\e' is the standard way to emit a\nbackslash, and the way that makes man-db not cry.\n",
                  "parents": [
                    {
                      "id": "afeda241f3f9b2c27e461f32d9c2a704ab82ef61"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "afeda241f3f9b2c27e461f32d9c2a704ab82ef61",
